2. **Give the catch site the resolved context** — `src/cmd/mod.rs::dispatch` (`src/cmd/mod.rs:29-39`) and `src/cmd/run.rs::run` (`src/cmd/run.rs:24-49`), read by `main` (`dispatch`'s only caller, `main` @ `src/main.rs:44`, research.md §Graph impact). When `dispatch` returns `Err`, the catch site must know three things:
