   - the home, once `dispatch` resolved it (`src/cmd/mod.rs:30-35`);
   - the instance, once clap parsed `RunArgs.name`.

   Both home and instance are known BEFORE `viola_obs_init` (`src/cmd/run.rs:26`). The context must reach the catch site even when `viola_obs_init` itself fails, and `PANIC_SINK` (`src/main.rs:26`) is set only after the role file opens (`src/obs.rs:149-151`), so the catch site cannot rely on it alone. The carrier's shape is /implement's choice, within `## Constraints & rejected approaches`.

