   - (b) the forced catch-site error of step 7;
   - (c) a run with `config.json` `{"v":1,"diagnostics_level":"debug"}`.

   After each run, walk EVERY file under that home (role files, detail files, the fake-agent receipt under `<home>/fake/`) plus the run's stdout and stderr. Assert no canary value occurs. A hit is reported as file + canary class, never the matched bytes (test-plan §6 hit-report form). The canary strings are literals in the test, never imported from product code (test-plan §11 Unit).

